  "body": "Orakei remains one of Auckland’s most established and sought-after coastal residential suburbs, prized for its convenience, lifestyle amenity, and close proximity to Mission Bay, Orakei Beach, and a direct, easy commute to the CBD.\r\n\r\nThis unique ground-floor apartment enjoys exceptional accessibility, offering three entry points from the building frontage, along with private access directly from Ngaiwi Street.\r\n\r\nLarge internal living, extends to 47 sqm of private terracing and a further 90 sqm (approx.) of private lawn. This generous outdoor space is a rare and valuable bonus, ideal for grandparents with a small dog and providing a safe, secure area for visiting grandchildren to play.\r\n\r\nSuperior fixtures and fittings throughout, a modern kitchen, and two well-appointed bathrooms complete the home. Secure under-cover parking for one vehicle, along with a large storage room, adds further benefits. \r\n\r\nGuest parking is conveniently located directly in front of the building, as shown in the photographic tour.\r\n\r\nEnjoy modern-day living with peace of mind.\r\n\r\nGround-floor Garden apartments of this calibre rarely come to market.\r\n\r\nPriced to sell.",
